---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — nerdstuckathome">
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="avatar">L</div>
    <h1>Hey, I'm Luca</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I've been writing software for a living since 2008: about three years in Italy, three
        in London, and the rest in the Netherlands, where I live now.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of those years were frontend, about ten of them with React and TypeScript, at
        Treatwell, EclecticIQ and Intel 471. EclecticIQ, a cybersecurity company, is where I
        stayed longest. In six years there I became the person the team asked about Content
        Security Policy, and for six months I was acting engineering manager of a five-person
        team. At Intel 471 I built the frontend of a new product from zero, until a
        restructuring closed the whole team.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Workera I moved to full stack, with Elixir and Phoenix LiveView, and owned the LLM
        features of a production AI product: agents, tool calling, model routing. That's the
        work I want to keep doing. I'm looking for applied AI engineering roles, remote or in
        the Netherlands.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started this blog in 2012 on WordPress, writing about whatever I was stuck on, which
        is where the name comes from. These days the posts are mostly about self-hosting, LLM
        tooling and frontend security. The site now runs on a VPS I manage myself; the old
        posts are still on <a href="https://nerdstuckathome.wordpress.com">the WordPress
        archive</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work I hunt bugs on Intigriti and release my side projects as open source,
        like <a href="https://github.com/lzzluca/cspgen">cspgen</a>, a CLI for reviewing,
        versioning and rolling out a Content Security Policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/lzzluca">GitHub</a> and
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lzzluca">LinkedIn</a>, or follow the blog via
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    flex-grow: 1;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 56px 64px 80px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .avatar {
    width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--ink);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    color: var(--bg);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 24px; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-page { padding: 32px 20px 60px; }
  }
</style>
